      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "PAW WARRINGAH (1) showed strong early pace and proved too slick around Warrnambool over 390m in 22.47, claiming a Grade 5 by half a length. The one to beat again. PAW MURBELLA (8) has missed the frame at her last couple but wasn't beaten far three back when second (22.26) at this track in a Grade 5. This looks easier and expected to improve sharply. CASH ME OUT (2) broke a string of placings finishing in the money two on end before a last start fourth (24.33) at Bendigo. Has a good record at this journey. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from six attempts. Leading chance. BLAME KARISSA (7) can fill a top-three spot.",
